WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.630
Two figures on a sheet of ice.

2
00:00:02.680 --> 00:00:04.610
One of ordinary height.

3
00:00:04.660 --> 00:00:06.650
One very tall.

4
00:00:06.700 --> 00:00:09.950
Between them, a crack slowly widens.

5
00:00:10.000 --> 00:00:10.950
Maker.

6
00:00:11.000 --> 00:00:11.910
Made.

7
00:00:11.960 --> 00:00:12.750
Father?

8
00:00:12.800 --> 00:00:13.940
Child?

9
00:00:13.990 --> 00:00:17.230
The taller one says: "Yet you, my creator,

10
00:00:17.280 --> 00:00:20.570
detest and spurn me, thy creature".

11
00:00:20.620 --> 00:00:22.410
One made the other.

12
00:00:22.460 --> 00:00:25.370
So which of these two is the real monster?

13
00:00:25.420 --> 00:00:29.490
In this mission, you'll ask what
a creator owes his creation.

14
00:00:29.540 --> 00:00:32.520
The Creature demands:
"Do your duty towards me,

15
00:00:32.570 --> 00:00:34.440
and I will do mine".

16
00:00:34.490 --> 00:00:37.310
You'll see that Victor, the
Creature and a third man,

17
00:00:37.360 --> 00:00:41.070
the explorer Walton, are each
cut off from other people.

18
00:00:41.120 --> 00:00:44.360
And you'll weigh the evidence
on each side of the crack.

19
00:00:44.410 --> 00:00:47.810
Your mission: decide
who the real monster is:

20
00:00:47.860 --> 00:00:49.720
the maker, or the made.
